[Observations and harness controls]
# 26 phase checks: 11 wide routes with active Next before answer; 11 mobile controls with no rendered/AX button;
# 2 routes at 1359 + 2 at 1360, same light non-touch profile. Confidence SVG box 418×418 wide / 13×13 compact.
# 11 extended scenarios: three native, six sheet (incl. Escape controls and keyboard skip), real iframe, disclosures.
# Chromium AX: Playwright ariaSnapshot plus CDP Accessibility.getPartialAXTree for exact live/name/state nodes.
# Mobile modal leakage after Next: Gill I and generic series, non-ignored focused background skip link while open.
# Escape result sampled after 520ms, exceeding the 8 attempts at 60ms intervals (0..420ms) in site-utils.js.
# Browser keys are ordinary Tab/Shift+Tab, ArrowRight, Enter and Escape; #sec-quiz/#quiz are native start fragments.
# The Settings opener and the map's first topic alone use initial locator.focus; neither follow-up flow refocuses via JS.
# The 11+11 phase checks and four boundary checks use ordinary pointer clicks for entry; click is not forced.
# The native source handoff uses native keyboard activation and page.goBack (browser history).
# Service Workers blocked. Host resolver denies non-local lookups. No pageerror or HTTP >=400 on local origin in 37/37.
# No full AT output, Windows HCM, physical phone, live domain, Safari or Firefox in this package.
# Initial incorrect expectations: mobile Next did not reach a new confidence button within 12 tabs; measured focus
# on the actual background link instead. Map first retry probe matched 1/4 in the outgoing score card; wait for
# the actual first question heading and option nodes after AnimatePresence. Keyboard retry after mount works.
# The capture scrolls the dialog itself to the enabled pre-answer Next; does not manipulate author styles.

